---

Map geometry is derived from Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/),
1:10m Cultural Vectors, Admin 0 - Countries, which is in the public domain.

Subdivision maps under subdivisions/ are derived from the following geographic
data, whose terms apply in addition to (and separately from) the MIT License
above:

- us, ca, au, nz, ie: Natural Earth 1:10m Admin 1 - States, Provinces (v5.1.2),
  public domain.
- gb: Source: Office for National Statistics licensed under the Open Government
  Licence v.3.0. Contains OS data (c) Crown copyright and database right 2025.
  (International Territorial Level 2 (January 2025) Boundaries UK BUC)
- kr: This data is derived from administrative-dong boundaries released by
  Statistics Korea SGIS (https://sgis.kostat.go.kr) under KOGL Type 1, modified
  by vuski/admdongkor (https://github.com/vuski/admdongkor), distributed under
  CC BY 4.0. Dissolved into 16 first-level divisions by kazutax/world-map-svg.
- sg: Contains information from Master Plan 2025 Region Boundary (No Sea)
  accessed on 2026-10-13 from data.gov.sg which is made available under the
  terms of the Singapore Open Data Licence version 1.0
  https://data.gov.sg/open-data-licence
